    "attributes": {
        "action": "Establish a UK UAP Reporting Centre and maintain data and report to the public",
        "additional_details": "This petition seeks a national UAP reporting office to handle incidents relevant to UK security and to share that data with the public.",
        "background": "Establish a public unidentified aerial phenomenon (UAP) reporting office and publish non sensitive data via a public website. The US has AARO with major funding for investigations. We feel the UK\u2019s silence is unacceptable; the public deserves a national UAP reporting service and, the truth.",
